===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Nidorino|58}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Nidorino}}.
*{{m|Horn Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Nidorino}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

